        {
          "text": "Hano ömooka gosiirre, ömögambi Nebhugatinesa naatömërë abhantö bhakaimukia Yehoyakini ubhunyambu bhakamuhira Bhabheri, hamui na ibhintö bhi iriguri irinene bhi inyumba yö ÖMÖNENE. Agatööra Setekia, mura omoobho, köbha ömögambi wa Yuta na Yerusaremu.",
          "type": "text",
